<title>INDIA: Indian Feb cement output rises to 6.56 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Feb cement output rises to 6.56 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian cement production rose in February to 6.56 million tonnes from 6.32 million in the same month in 1996, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>    CEMENT PRODUCTION    Feb 97	Feb 96	 Apr-Feb</p>
<p>							    1996/97  1995/96</p>
<p>				 6,559	  6,318    68,434   62,676</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
